er&quot;&gt;https://www.ahhhhfs.com/82137/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/e-FOHqCnoFyMeMx4IByeCFFWC4u9C2Km0S64QtSVqZvz5hKIIdIcfRpC2bh3dFC6wD2CFPjia40jtnzBoep1EASDK8IdcT7o8o-t9vZ_Kskrd5r8GFLA6hvODk-Zt7vgHGD__1ZMP3nLkPSA-_3-Sa5GteT24ufvm6kSu9wM8RKPKO-vgZIUpTggZZJKZxvS_y9ttgLiWP8cdcAbvOH2sFeh8pr6Bl9QOV5j_zMQ_We3TOMvHdlzeSj_7nkjwsP-JrUuyNEqjW9qDPdWzUp5eSz7Q3Div_DPqA-FfNkOqWT2GDcVLECGU3sHW-c7Ci7zc7UIAEFjmsXWzA2iU31fnA.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;</description><link>https://t.me/abskoop/13065</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://t.me/abskoop/13065</guid><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 16:20:40 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>🖼 MIFARE Classic Tool (MCT)：一个开源 Android NFC 应用</title><description>&lt;p&gt;MIFARE Classic Tool (MCT)：一个开源 Android NFC 应用&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;专门用来读取、写入、分析、克隆 NFC 标签&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;iOS用户可用来把门禁卡复制到 NFC空白芯片，贴在手机后面刷手机开门了&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;加密的门禁卡 一般不行&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;安卓用户的NFC 一般 可以直接添加的，感兴趣的可以试试&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;emoji&quot;&gt;👉&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ikarus23/MifareClassicTool&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/ikarus23/MifareClassicTool&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/EqWq_JuYar2Z1YOpfD_cBjVmdg_Fx1Glz3C6smIdEjoQHI3e0vXSRUbmNsLWyB5GbrBLqbgwiPhcYlVtk_0MiWpr6cauhD_q0mZamD58qsNsTwU2WKCvMapJD7Q2Y6bbJitQC0LmBpk0qW5eQMmninCNQvtXeDtly3NVIItkFD766xyILjZ-m7NnN8tNXvg13yI8P-9xbqZ88mIPCcMNqyzTwDnnAN4qI3E9OPlatrHqIamEa0JSUW2BX7jHKu_RYjBU6FL8tOyd7Xx39CnYeyQcOMJqtDL_uvUapX6QwBKy6OufilFkgtbNdh7gaQ62HuGcsGAhfibfq67BJUT2Gg.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;</description><link>https://t.me/abskoop/13064</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://t.me/abskoop/13064</guid><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 13:28:57 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>🖼 同花顺官方出了套 A 股数据接口：同花顺金融数据API（Financial-API）</title><description>&lt;p&gt;同花顺官方出了套 A 股数据接口：同花顺金融数据API（Financial-API）&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;支